/* 微信绑定（账号安全 · 子目录）：绑定徽标与微信资料编辑浮层（自原账号安全页迁入） */
@import "../../styles/cell-list.wxss";

/* ============ 微信绑定状态（2026-09-29） ============ */
.bind-tag {
  padding: 4rpx 18rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  font-size: 23rpx;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.bind-tag.on { color: #0f7a55; background: rgba(19,121,91,0.12); }
.bind-tag.off { color: #6b7c90; background: rgba(20,40,60,0.08); }
.bind-tag.unknown { color: #d97706; background: rgba(217,119,6,0.12); }
.danger-text { color: #b93838; }

/* ============ 微信资料编辑浮层（2026-10-12） ============ */
.wx-avatar-sm {
  width: 44rpx;
  height: 44rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #eef2f7;
}
.overlay {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 999;
}
.overlay-mask {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(10, 22, 40, 0.45);
}
.wxp-sheet {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 28rpx 28rpx 0 0;
  padding: 36rpx 32rpx calc(40rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 28rpx;
}
.wxp-head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8rpx; }
.wxp-title { font-size: 32rpx; font-weight: 600; color: #12253d; }
.wxp-sub { font-size: 23rpx; color: #9aa9bb; line-height: 1.5; }
.wxp-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 24rpx;
}
.wxp-label { width: 100rpx; font-size: 26rpx; color: #6b7c90; }
.wxp-avatar-btn {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8rpx;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
  background: transparent;
  line-height: 1;
}
.wxp-avatar-btn::after { border: none; }
.wxp-avatar {
  width: 120rpx;
  height: 120rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #eef2f7;
  border: 2rpx solid #e3eaf2;
}
.wxp-avatar-hint { font-size: 20rpx; color: #9aa9bb; }
/* 头像列：微信头像按钮 + 相册兜底入口（叠加竖排，居中） */
.wxp-avatar-col {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10rpx;
}
.wxp-album-link {
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #185fa5;
  text-decoration: underline;
}
/* ⚠️ 输入框高度：同优先级后段压前段的坑 → 只写一份，不给默认 input 样式留叠加机会 */
.wxp-input {
  flex: 1;
  height: 84rpx;
  padding: 0 24rpx;
  border-radius: 14rpx;
  background: #f3f6fa;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: #12253d;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.wxp-save {
  margin-top: 8rpx;
}
